Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 verify-iso-sig - verify the GPG signature of a downloaded ISO image
Changes:
 verify-iso-sig (2026.08.06) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Get the ISO name from a plain checksum file's own content when
     needed.
   * Prefer a clearsigned per-ISO checksum over a direct .sig when
     resolving a plain checksum, matching bare-ISO auto-discovery.
   * GUI: the run-once lock now also covers --manage-keys.
   * GUI: fixed a lock-release gap after a backgrounded child.
   * GUI: the run-once notification now names whichever window is
     already open.
   * GUI: fixed the progress popup not closing when yad is a wrapper
     script rather than the real binary.
   * Warn when a checksum relies on MD5 or SHA1.
